# Edge tiles (shore = grass/water, pathedge = grass/stone path). Generated layout, hand-tuned profiles.
# Placement: the tile sits on a WATER / STONE-PATH cell. Bits N=1 E=2 S=4 W=8 are set when that neighbour is GRASS.
#   1 edge_n  2 edge_e  4 edge_s  8 edge_w | 3 corner_ne  6 corner_se  12 corner_sw  9 corner_nw
#   0 with only the NE/SE/SW/NW diagonal grass -> inner_ne/se/sw/nw | 0 with no grass diagonal -> tile_water / stone_path
#   (5, 10, 7, 11, 13, 14, 15 and two diagonals are not covered: keep water/path at least 2 cells wide).
# Shore frames follow tile_water frame for frame (same pixels in open water, foam ripples), so play them in sync.

